# Bold spans a wrap: ESC E stays attached to the upcoming word and the
# ESC F is held with the word it follows.
# Line 1: aaaaa SP ESC_E bbbbb               (col 11 of 12)
# Line 2: cccccc ESC_F SP ddddd              (col 12 of 12)
# Line 3: eeeeee                             (wrap because adding " eeeeee" would overflow)
61 61 61 61 61  20  1B 45  62 62 62 62 62  0A
63 63 63 63 63 63  1B 46  20  64 64 64 64 64  0A
65 65 65 65 65 65  0A
